name walk-baldur-spell
title Elder Baldur killed with Vengeful Spirit and the nail, closed loop, from the seeded card east of him in Crossroads_11_alt (SOUL 0, no cheat)
max_ticks 40000
# crossroads-11-alt-east.mcd is a seeded record (docs/ROUTES.md) at the arrival gate with Vengeful Spirit (fireballLevel 1). A card does not save SOUL,
# so this starts at the worst case, SOUL 0: the Knight earns the casts from the Rollers Baldur spits (11 SOUL a nail hit). A run that comes out of the
# Mound arrives with 99 SOUL and needs one fewer roller.
card crossroads-11-alt-east.mcd
wait 300
press cross
wait 40
press cross
wait until HK_GAME_MODE == 1 timeout 1200
include baldur-defs.walk
include crossroads-11-alt.walk
include baldur-round.walk times 220
check baldur-dead HK_ENEMY_KILLS == 1 ; HK_ENEMY_HITS == 4 ; HK_ROLLERS_KILLED >= 3 ; HK_DEATHS == 0 ; HK_CHEATS == 0 ; HK_HEALTH >= 1
